        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(d) The President of each Local shall notify Local Management, in writing, as to the Representatives of the Local who are authorized by the Local to represent Employees in certain territories for the purpose of settling grievances not settled by Job Stewards. This notice shall clearly state the territories and jurisdictions delegated to such Representatives.",
